'''Dr. Hibble''' is an [[NPC]] located in the {{Zone|Black Lagoon}}. After speaking to {{NPCSprite|Kay}}, their name changes to '''Dr. Edwin''', and they allow the player to access the {{Zone|Leeches Lair}}.

